[00:13.62]1. We love Jehovah with heart, mind, and soul;
[00:22.88]But since we are sinful, we need self-control.
[00:32.80]Fleshly desires bring trouble and strife;
[00:42.64]Living by spirit brings peace and life.
[01:06.18]2. Satan’s temptations confront us each day,
[01:15.06]And sin’s law within us can lead us astray.
[01:26.24]Power of truth is greater than sin.
[01:33.72]Thanks to Jehovah, our minds can win.
[01:33.80]3. Each word and action reflects on God’s name,
[01:33.82]So we must endeavor to keep free from blame.
[01:33.82]In all we do, we make this our goal:
[01:33.82]Always maintaining our self-control.
